# Builder handoff — FULL spec (not a summary)

## Two audiences — never mix them

| Audience | What they get |
|----------|----------------|
| **Coordinator (user)** | Short verdict, symptoms, next step — plain English |
| **Builder (paste block)** | **FULL handoff below** — self-contained, no "see above" |

Builder does **not** see screenshots, log analysis, MegaLens, or your long explanations. If it's not in the paste block, Builder guesses.

## When to paste FULL handoff

- Every Audit **FAIL** → full block to Builder
- Every **P0/P1** fix request → full block
- Coordinator says "send to Builder" → full block

Thin 6-row tables are **REJECTED** by `builder-audit-handoff-gate.mdc`.

