## Auditor instant-fail (on self)

- Handoff says "see earlier" / "as discussed"
- P0 without `file:line` + BEFORE/AFTER
- No LOG PROOF section with real paths
- No REFERENCE section when bug is map/pins/UI (use ORIGINAL QUEST TRACKER)
- No USER TEST pass/fail log lines
